  "content": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/835564/description_f97780b4-56a3-41cd-b922-6be25e8a4953.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"506\" height=\"506\"></p>\n<p>Recrafted Creatures 是一个小型动物模组，添加了长颈鹿、小熊猫、斑马、猛犸象、土拨鼠、变色龙、猫头鹰、海狸、秘书鸟和红毛猩猩等新动物。每个生物都经过精心设计，以契合原版风格，让游戏世界更加生机勃勃。每种生物的详细介绍请参见图片。</p>\n<p>-----------------------------补充说明----------------------------------<br><br>欢迎将我们的模组和 Duclib 添加到任何模组包中。<br><br>---------------------------------------依赖要求------------------------------------------</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/duclib\" rel=\"nofollow\">此模组需要安装 Duclib 才能正常运行<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/783/889/638132170966224697.png\" alt=\"ducklib\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli\" rel=\"nofollow\">虽然可选，但下载 Patchouli 可解锁游戏内指南书功能。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/835564/description_b706f7d6-82ab-40f8-aa2f-ed221ed0dcb3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"27\" height=\"27\"></a></p>\n<p>----------------媒体链接----------------</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ueprzpvrpw\" rel=\"nofollow\">加入我们的 Discord 服务器！</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/Itskillerluc/recrafted_creatures\" rel=\"nofollow\">如果遇到任何错误，欢迎在 GitHub 上报告。我们非常感谢您提供关于错误现象及复现步骤的详细信息！</a><br><img src=\"https://www.curseforge.com/project/2023-03-08_17.02.14.png\" alt=\"\"></p>",
